  "sandboxContract": {
    "network": "The Docker sidecar is configured with network_mode: none. Remote services must be reached through scoped HTTP/TCP tools in the API process.",
    "filesystem": "Challenge input is mounted read-only; every run receives a dedicated scratchRoot/runs/<run-id> namespace with isolated cwd, HOME, and TMPDIR.",
    "execution": "Commands are structured as program + args + optional stdin. Shell parsing is not used. Run namespaces prevent normal tool-protocol access to another run's scratch files; deployment-level containers or microVMs are required for mutually untrusted tenant kernel isolation."
